### 东信和平亮灯控制接口测试
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8090

### 1. 成功-自动亮灯（mode=1）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/control
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-LIGHT-0001",
  "userId": "USER-LIGHT-01",
  "mode": 1,
  "color": "GREEN",
  "duration": "inf"
}

### 2. 成功-手动灭灯（mode=4）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/control
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-LIGHT-0002",
  "userId": "USER-LIGHT-02",
  "mode": 4,
  "duration": "0"
}

### 3. 参数错误-mode非法（预期400）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/control
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-LIGHT-0003",
  "userId": "USER-LIGHT-03",
  "mode": 9
}

### 4. 参数错误-color非法（预期400）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/control
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-LIGHT-0004",
  "userId": "USER-LIGHT-04",
  "mode": 1,
  "color": "WHITE",
  "duration": "inf"
}

### 5. 参数错误-duration非法（预期400）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/control
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waveNo": "WV-LIGHT-0005",
  "userId": "USER-LIGHT-05",
  "mode": 2,
  "color": "GREEN",
  "duration": "99m"
}

### 6. 参数错误-缺少waveNo（预期400）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/light/control
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER-LIGHT-06",
  "mode": 1
}
